INFO | 2025-11-25 16:06:28,258 | main | search | Comic: {'aliases': None, 'api_detail_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/api/issue/4000-1139062/', 'cover_date': '2025-12-01', 'date_added': '2025-10-21 12:46:00', 'date_last_updated': '2025-10-26 19:51:00', 'deck': None, 'description': '<p><em><b>THE TRUTH OF THE AMAZONS!</b></em></p><p><em>As Diana learns more of the "myth of the Amazons" from Barbara in Gateway City, a series of violent supernatural events begins occurring one after another, drawing Diana all over the globe to fight. Noticing a pattern, Diana enlists Etta to help her crack the mystery of why these events are happening in these places and how to stop them.</em></p><p><em>The answer?</em></p><p><em>Too personal to imagine.</em></p>', 'has_staff_review': False, 'id': 1139062, 'image': {'icon_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/square_avatar/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'medium_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'screen_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/screen_medium/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'screen_large_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/screen_kubrick/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'small_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'super_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'thumb_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_avatar/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'tiny_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/square_mini/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'original_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/original/11/110017/9897366-wwww.jpg', 'image_tags': 'All Images'}, 'associated_images': [], 'issue_number': '13', 'name': 'The Price, Part 1 of 2', 'site_detail_url': 'https://comicvine.gamespot.com/absolute-wonder-woman-13-the-price-part-1-of-2/4000-1139062/', 'store_date': '2025-10-22', 'volume': {'api_detail_url': 'https://comicvine.gamesp